// BASIC profile: gateway calls by operation and status code, last 24h.
//
// This one does NOT depend on Application Insights custom metrics at all - it reads
// the APIM resource log - so it still works when emit-metric is being dropped
// (issue #16) or while you are still wiring diagnostics up. Best first stop when
// something is failing.
//
// READING THE RESULT:
//   404 on an operation you expect  -> that operation does not exist on the API
//   404 with NO OperationId         -> nothing matched the path at all; check the
//                                      API URL suffix (must be 'openai' for Copilot CLI)
//   401                             -> subscription key rejected BEFORE policy ran:
//                                      wrong header (APIM defaults to
//                                      Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key, the CLI can only
//                                      send api-key), or the key is not scoped to
//                                      this API/product
//   200 here but the client still fails -> look at the BACKEND leg instead; use the
//                                      end-to-end transaction view, whose dependency
//                                      row shows the resolved upstream URL
ApiManagementGatewayLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| summarize Calls = count() by bin(TimeGenerated, 1h), OperationId, ResponseCode
| order by TimeGenerated desc, Calls desc
